OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Burnham should back EU
OL,4,Amembership now, says Plaid Westminster
OL,5,Aleader
OL,6,
OL,7,FPlaid Cymru's leader in Westminster
OL,8,Fsays Andy Burnham should back rejoining
OL,9,Fthe EU now, and not delay his decision
OL,10,Funtil the next general election.
OL,12,FThe prime minister has said it is
OL,13,F"possible" that a future Labour
OL,14,Felection manifesto could promise a new
OL,15,Fin-out referendum on the European
OL,16,FUnion.
OL,18,FLiz Saville Roberts said she would
OL,19,Fwelcome any commitment by Burnham to
OL,20,Freverse Brexit, claiming Wales would be
OL,21,Fbetter off in the political and
OL,22,Feconomic bloc.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
